.TH IDLESCREEN 1 "July 2026" "idlescreen" "IdleScreen CLI"
.SH NAME
idlescreen \- control the IdleScreen daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B idlescreen
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIARGS\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B idlescreen
is the CLI for the IdleScreen user daemon
.BR idle-daemon (1).
It controls idle presentation, previews plugins, and runs diagnostics over D-Bus.
.br
Note: this package does
.B not
install
.BR /usr/bin/idle ,
which is reserved for Fedora's
.B python3-idle
(Python IDE).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tui
Launch the live TUI dashboard (
.BR idle-tui ).
.TP
.B status
[\fB--json\fR]
Show daemon state.
.TP
.B on\fR, \fBenable
Enable idle screensaver.
.TP
.B off\fR, \fBdisable
Disable idle screensaver.
.TP
.BI timeout " <minutes>"
Set idle timeout (1–240 minutes).
.TP
.B list\fR, \fBsaver list
List installed savers.
.TP
.BI saver " set <name|random>"
Choose active saver.
.TP
.BI preview " <saver>"
Preview a saver now.
.TP
.B stop
Stop preview or idle presentation.
.TP
.B inhibitors
List active inhibitors.
.TP
.BI fps-overlay " on|off|status"
FPS overlay control.
.TP
.BI render-scale " <0.25-1.0>|default|status"
Simulation render scale.
.TP
.B doctor
[\fB--fix\fR] [\fB--json\fR]
System diagnostics. \fB--fix\fR reloads/enables the user unit.
.TP
.B config
\fBget\fR|\fBset\fR|\fBlist\fR
Read or write daemon config keys.
.TP
.B self-update
Check package updates (dnf/apt).
.TP
.B interactive
Simple console menu.
.TP
.B version\fR, \fBabout
Version and project info.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/idle/config.yaml
Daemon configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR idle-daemon (1),
.BR idle-tui (1)
